<section id="faq" class="section">
  <div class="faq-head reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow-mono" style="justify-content:center">Questions</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Questions, answered</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-groups reveal reveal-d1">

    <div class="faq-group">
      <h3 class="faq-group-title">Multiplayer and teams</h3>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can my whole team work on the same agent?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Share an agent and choose who can use it and who can manage it. Everyone works from the same mission board and can pick up a mission where someone else left off.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What are the roles?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Three: Owner, Manager, and Member. The owner runs billing and can do anything. Managers add people, create agents, and change settings. Members use the agents they are given.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Who sees which agents?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>You choose, per agent. People only see and use the agents shared with them, so the rest of the workspace stays private.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What is a space?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Everyone gets a free personal space that is just for them. Team spaces sit beside it for shared work, and you switch between them in a click.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I set guardrails on a shared agent?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. For each shared agent you choose which apps and which AI models it may use. Everyone still picks their own model within what you allow.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does sharing an agent lose its history?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>No. Move it into a team and it keeps its history and skills, and teammates can pick up any mission from where it stands.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Desktop or web?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Both. Reach the same spaces, agents, and missions from the desktop app or the web.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-group">
      <h3 class="faq-group-title">Agents and tools</h3>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What agents come built in?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>A full team: personal assistant, bookkeeper, HR manager, support rep, sales rep, office manager, financial analyst, growth lead, and more.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I add or build more?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Browse 30+ more in the <a href="https://agents.gethouston.ai">Agent Store</a>, or build your own in minutes.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What can agents connect to?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Over 1,000 tools you already use, like Gmail, Slack, QuickBooks, HubSpot, and Google Drive.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Do I pay for AI separately?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>No. Houston runs on the ChatGPT or Claude plan you already pay for, so there is no second AI bill.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-group">
      <h3 class="faq-group-title">Pricing and billing</h3>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Is Personal really free?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes, forever. Unlimited agents and every single-player feature, with no credit card and no time limit.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Who pays for a team?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>The owner. Everyone you invite rides on the owner's plan, so members never enter a card of their own.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What counts as a seat?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>One member who accepts your invite. Pending invites are free, and seats are prorated when people join or leave.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How does the free trial work?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>A team space gets a {{ pricing.trialDays }}-day free trial with no card. It starts when your second member accepts.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What happens when the trial ends?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Nothing is deleted. Your space drops back to the free plan and every agent and mission stays put. Add a card whenever you are ready.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Do members download or pay?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Members just accept the invite and download the free app. Billing stays with the owner.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Around-the-clock and enterprise?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Team keeps shared agents running even when laptops are closed. Enterprise adds single sign-on, an uptime SLA, priority support in English and Spanish, and private deployment.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-group">
      <h3 class="faq-group-title">Getting the app</h3>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Which systems is Houston on?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Download for
            <button class="dl-os-link" data-dl-trigger data-dl-source="faq-os" data-dl-os="mac">macOS</button> or
            <button class="dl-os-link" data-dl-trigger data-dl-source="faq-os" data-dl-os="windows">Windows</button>.
            On Windows, pick x64 (Intel or AMD) or ARM64 (Surface, Snapdragon).</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How do I get in?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Houston is in a closed beta. Paste your invite code to download, or <a href="/waitlist/">join the waiting list</a>.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
